{"id":"n89202-1-7","stage":4,"title":"흐트러지다 · 散乱","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89202-1-7-1","ko":"방이 너무 지저분한데 뭐부터 치울까?","zh":"房间太乱了，该从哪儿开始收拾呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방이","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방이","audio":"/audio/f8b8dcbdcf795ca5e772.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"지저분한데","meaning":"杂乱","explanation":"지저분하다：杂乱；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"지저분하다","audio":"/audio/8db48a7863a37c7a29f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27948","senseId":"1","lemma":"지저분하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지저분한데","audio":"/audio/c6bec1a9ec369232bcce.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐부터","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐부터","audio":"/audio/042ec9ac485e910cecaa.mp3"}},{"text":"치울까?","meaning":"清扫，收起，归整","explanation":"치우다：清扫，收起，归整；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"치우다","audio":"/audio/2e26bfacf9dbdb051cd0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89815","senseId":"2","lemma":"치우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치울까","audio":"/audio/6ed4c86644c29c58989b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"b039867287